# backend/internal/api/routes/keys/hecate-ca.key: Hecate/Orthrus agent CA seed key (dev/test artifact)
# This EC P-256 private key is a pre-seeded development fixture for the Orthrus mTLS PKI subsystem.
# Production code (NewInternalCA in backend/internal/orthrus/ca.go) generates its own CA key at
# runtime from a configurable dataRoot directory and does NOT use this path in production.
# The file is gitignored via *.key in .gitignore and is NOT committed to git history.
# It exists only on the local development filesystem for testing convenience.
# Assessed as dev artifact in QA audits 2026-05-18 and 2026-06-03. Rotate before production use.
backend/internal/api/routes/keys/hecate-ca.key

